{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルのスイカに塩はかける？\n私はかけない派☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日私のソロツアー\n真夏の全国ツアーに向けて\n頑張っていますヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソロツアーはウソです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って当たり前か...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん暑いけど体調\n崩してませんか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/07/31/4575412/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"STREET JACKオフショット♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいとまいちゅんと\n3人でグラビア撮って\nいただきました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は撮影でスイカ食べられる\n機会が多くて嬉しいなっヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ先日、といっても\nもう一週間経っちゃったのか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週の握手会のお話(σ･ω･)σ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土曜日の全握は\nかりんちゃん×真夏ペア♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんちゃんはすごくノリが良くて\n頭の回転が早い子なので\n隣で会話を聞いていてもとても\n楽しかったです(〃ω〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにズッキュンしてっ！って\n言われてちゃんとしてたのが\n可愛かった...♡♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/07/31/4575412/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぷちゅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんちゃんファンのみなさん\n1日お世話になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お陰様ですごく楽しく1日\n過ごすことが出来ました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして2日目は個握♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の握手会だったから\nみなさん髪型が変わっていたり\nガッツリ焼けていたり\nダイエットに成功していたり...\nなどなどそれぞれ久しぶりの\n再会を楽しめて嬉しかったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"常連さんもお久しぶりさんも\n初めましてさんもお試しさんも\n本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！私服紹介いきまーす♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1・2・5部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/07/31/4575412/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピース:snidel"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3・4部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/07/31/4575412/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピース:snidel"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちの私服は大人っぽいと\n言ってもらえることが\n多かったです(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ22歳だから\n雰囲気を大人っぽくを\nちょっぴり心掛けております♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも心はまだ少女っ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日の名古屋の個握では\n浴衣を着るよっ∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前ようやく購入出来たの♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"も